#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "112_Owner"
msgid "Well, if it isn't Akiyama-san!"
msgstr "¡Pero si es Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "124_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey there, Chef. How's your back?"
msgstr "Buenas, chef. ¿Cómo está su espalda?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "136_Owner"
msgid "Oh, it's jacked... Honestly, I'm achin' all the time. Hurts\\r\nso damn much, I can't even get down the stairs."
msgstr "Oh, está destrozada... Honestamente me duele todo\nel tiempo. No puedo ni bajar las escaleras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "148_Akiyama"
msgid "Sorry to hear that... Listen, can I ask you to contact me if\\r\nyou see anybody like this?"
msgstr "Siento oír eso... Escuche, ¿podría contactarme si ve a alguien con estas pintas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "160_Owner"
msgid "The hell's this? Your daughter draw it?"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto...? ¿Su hija lo dibujó?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "172_Akiyama"
msgid "Like I've got kids...? Look, I know it's terrible, but\\r\napparently it really captures the essence of the guy."
msgstr "Soy soltero. Oiga, sé que es terrible... Pero\ncaptura la esencia del tipo que busco."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "184_Owner"
msgid "You don't say...? Well, okay. I'll show it to my staff."
msgstr "¿Usted crees...? Bueno. Entonces se lo mostraré a mi personal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "196_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks. I'll have to bring Hana-chan by one of these days."
msgstr "Gracias. En estos días vendré a comer con Hana-chan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "208_Owner"
msgid "Sure thing! But call me the day before, will ya? I gotta\\r\nstock up before she gets here! That gal can eat! Gahaha!"
msgstr "¡Claro! Pero llámeme el día anterior. ¡Debo hacer las compras antes de que llegue ella! ¡Esa muchacha si que come! ¡Wa, ja, ja!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "220_Akiyama"
msgid "(Now for the Poppo in Nakamichi Alley. It's pretty desolate over that way... No telling what sort of shady characters might drop in.)"
msgstr "(Ahora al Poppo del callejón Nakamichi. Es un lugar bastante desolado, puede que aparezca algún tipo sospechoso)."

